  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Monitoring av Offentlig Finansiell Styrning Liberia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PFM Monitoring Liberia - PFM Monitoring Consultant Liberia - new strategy 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att genom en teknisk konsult st&#xf6;dja ambassaden i uppf&#xf6;ljningen av ambassadens PFM-insatser.

Det tekniska st&#xf6;det som konsulten kommer att ge inkludera f&#xf6;ljande:

1) St&#xf6;dja ambassadens beredning och uppf&#xf6;ljning av insatsen Integrated Public Financial Management Reform Project II.

2) St&#xf6;dja ambassadens i uppf&#xf6;ljningen av insatsen Overseas Development Institute&#x2019;s budgetf&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkningsinitiativ i Liberia.

3) St&#xf6;dja ambassadens beredning och uppf&#xf6;ljning av insatsen med Skatteverket och Liberia Revenue Authority (LRA).

Syftet &#xe4;r ocks&#xe5; att bygga en ram f&#xf6;r analys och l&#xe4;rande, d.v.s. att f&#xf6;lja upp resultat och risker p&#xe5; olika niv&#xe5;er i insatserna samt att f&#xf6;resl&#xe5; justeringar p&#xe5; insats- och policyniv&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to support the embassy in the follow-up of the Embassy&apos;s PFM-contributions through a technical consultant.

The technical support that the consultant will provide will include the following:

1) Support the Embassy in appraising and follow-up of the Integrated Public Financial Management Reform Project II.

2) Support the Embassy in the follow-up of the intervention Overseas Development Institute&apos;s budget strengthening initiative in Liberia.

3) Support the Embassy in appraising and follow-up of the contribution with the Swedish Tax Authority and the Liberia Revenue Authority (LRA).

The purpose is also to build a framework for analysis and learning, i.e. to follow up the results and risks at various levels in the contributions and to propose adjustments at the contribution and policy level.</narrative>
  </description>
